[{"id":177921731,"discussion_id":"3fe3f6c91453a1e780ef3f11a4e3009837874283","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| repo-cann/ops-math | ✅ [*冯彤*](https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng), [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (2/2) | ✅ [*冯彤*](https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n chenxingyu18, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-06-30T21:51:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T09:17:30+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177921971,"discussion_id":"31a0ddac3d855f1adf8e555198126e8a0ce63ebe","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-06-30T21:53:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T21:53:20+08:00","user":{"id":"68848a0ebac92f260ce335ef","login":"chenxingyu18","object_id":"68848a0ebac92f260ce335ef","name":"chenxingyu18","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenxingyu18"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177922104,"discussion_id":"b84ea58da1c5d96da601f2108f017b9e2aaa56f8","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `cdist_grad` 算子在 arch35 架构下反向梯度计算产生 NaN 的问题。根因在于：当正向 `cdist` 下溢为 0 时，`ratio = |diff| / (cdist + eps)` 中的分母退化为 `eps`，导致 `ratio` 爆炸，随后 `exp(log(ratio) * (p-1))` 上溢为 `+inf`，最终尾部 mask 执行 `inf * 0` 产生 NaN。修复方案是在计算 `ratio` 之前，先用 `cdist != 0` 的 mask 将 `|diff|` 置零，使 `ratio` 为 0 → `pow_ratio` 为 0 → 结果为 0，对齐 PyTorch CPU 在 `dist == 0` 时短路返回 0 的语义。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`CdistGradDag` 新增 `DagDiffAbsM` 中间节点**：在 `DagRatio` 计算之前，新增 `DagDiffAbsM = DagDiffAbs * DagMaskCdist`，将 `cdist == 0` 处的 `|diff|` 掩码为 0，避免后续除法爆炸；`DagRatio` 的输入由 `DagDiffAbs` 改为 `DagDiffAbsM`\n- **`CdistGradLargePDag` 等价新增 `LpDiffAbsM` 中间节点**：采用与 `CdistGradDag` 相同的修复逻辑，新增 `LpDiffAbsM = LpDiffAbs * LpMaskCdist`，并将 `LpRatio` 的输入由 `LpDiffAbs` 改为 `LpDiffAbsM`\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-30T21:54:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T21:54:21+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177922236,"discussion_id":"436a40bb2cb3919bb739471ea714d88ae5527af9","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipelineRunId=52d2cb47bc0c4868b5d60153d2b116c7&projectName=CANN'>52d2cb47bc0c4868b5d60153d2b116c7</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>pre_comment</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps