95489239c6db5449cf9733ef9abf1b7acc","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n**审查文件数：1**\n\n| 文件 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| `math/cdist_grad/op_kernel/arch35/cdist_grad_dag.h` | 1 个 P3 发现（注释准确性问题） |\n\n**发现统计：**\n- P0: 0\n- P1: 0\n- P2: 0\n- P3: 1（注释描述与实际计算不符，可能误导后续维护）\n\n**总体风险评估：低风险。** 该 diff 的核心修复逻辑正确：在 `cdist==0` 时先通过 mask 将 `|diff|` 置零，使 `ratio = 0 / eps = 0`，从而避免 `exp(log(ratio)*(p-1))` 上溢产生 NaN。两处修改（`CdistGradDag` 与 `CdistGradLargePDag`）在数值计算路径上等价且一致，尾部 mask 的重复应用无害（`0 * 0 = 0`, `1 * value = value`）。唯一的问题是注释中对中间值 `pow_ratio` 的描述不准确，但代码行为本身正确，不影响运行时正确性。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-30T21:57:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T21:57:48+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177925633,"discussion_id":"c2797e3878a82462845c5f0c58e8dd20319713d0","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:15:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:15:52+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","object_id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/rxtfeng"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177926431,"discussion_id":"a3d0e437c8bdc6cc4db3c82ac6c6526a0619f0dc","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:23:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:23:28+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","login":"FelixTang7","object_id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","name":"FelixTang7","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177926437,"discussion_id":"5701eed05a1e313dd996213f44e16cf04b153abf","body":"The following users do not have permission to comment `/lgtm` or `/approve` on any module in this PR:\n[*唐燕峰*](https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7)","created_at":"2026-06-30T22:23:32